1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,661
At twenty five degrees it is one times ten to the minus fourteen.

2
00:00:04,661 --> 00:00:10,937
In pure water the two are equal, ten to the minus seven moles per litre each.

3
00:00:10,937 --> 00:00:16,028
And this product holds in every aqueous solution, not just pure water.

